"edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T12:07:58-07:00","id":1417864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1417861#post1417861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Amici Noctis were the ones behind the clan\u2019s (or part of the clan\u2019s) defection, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Halfway.<br /> <br /> It was a plot between them and Anarch Emperor, Marcus Vitel.<br /> <br /> Because if you're going to have someone plot the destruction of the Lasombra, it might as well be arguably their most powerful member.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T12:40:59-07:00","id":1417875,"title":"","content":"They never should have had Vitel go Anarch and declare himself emperor. That makes, little sens to me in regards to the anarchs. I feel like he would get laughed out of office by the sect. He should have declared himself the new Emperor of the Eternal Senate. Cause that dude crazy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T12:43:14-07:00","id":1417876,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1417850#post1417850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If it's less than half the Clan, it's silly, because they'd be sacrificing themselves in the Gehenna Crusade and lose one of their awesome moments of treachery.<br /> <br /> They would also not be offering much to the Camarilla or warrant a Justicar or Inner Council.</div> </div> </div> </div>the Amici Noctis defected, the supposedly elite members of the clan in the sabbat, killing whatever elders on the way out (and alot of neonates),<br /> add to that the antitribu, who are mostly low gen elders,<br /> WHAT MORE DO YOU NEED?<br /> <br /> so what if it's less than half the lasombra? you got the core of the clan with you, what do you care about the rest?<br /> it's as if the Temere council of Nine defected, brought the Tremere elite with them, killed some on the way out, and complained about the remaining ones<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It'd be interesting to see how she would react to the fact that no sooner does she join the Sabbat after 800 years but:<br /> <br /> 1. Gehenna happens and its very likely the Sabbat ran right into the fangs of the Antediluvians.<br /> 2. All of the Lasombra find out the Antediluvian is alive.<br /> 3. The Amis Noctis' response is to join the Camarilla because, &quot;Well, we failed to kill him. Now we should join the side that are the Antediluvian's pawns.&quot;<br /> 4. The Sabbat effectively collapses into either remnants (The Seven Fires), is defeated by the Second Inquisition/Camarilla, or joins the rest of the Gehenna Crusade.<br /> <br /> I feel like this would make an awesome novel.<br /> <br /> Called, &quot;This was a terrible idea.&quot; </div> </div> </div>Phipps: characters should have causes, believe in them and see them crushed by reality<br /> <br /> also Phipps: Lucita is a stooge for believing in the sabbat and joining them,<br /> now her ambitions were crushed by gehenna,<br /> this shouldn't happen to my favorite waifu!<br /> <br /> Jesus man, leave her alone for two seconds,<br /> you sound like an overprotective boyfriend harrassing a random girl you believe was your girlfriend,<br /> no wonder she joined the sabbat, she was escaping from you<br /> <br /> *sigh*<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T12:47:07-07:00","id":1417878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperSabbatST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1417875#post1417875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They never should have had Vitel go Anarch and declare himself emperor. That makes, little sens to me in regards to the anarchs. I feel like he would get laughed out of office by the sect. He should have declared himself the new Emperor of the Eternal Senate. Cause that dude crazy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Most Anarchs want power and blood. Vitel can provide that in spades. I don't see the issue.<br /> <br /> Certainly, he could found his own variation of the Camarilla in the Americas if given enough time and a way around the Beckoning.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleides</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">this shouldn't happen to my favorite waifu!</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't be silly.<br /> <br /> Anita Wainwright is my favorite waifu in V:TM. Followed by Damsel and Lily.<br /> <br /> Lucita is more the kind of PC I'm always playing. I think of her as an Obternationa Lara Croft. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-12-2020, 03:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T12:47:57-07:00","id":1417879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1417845#post1417845\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25794_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25794\" data-vbnamecard=\"25794\">MyWifeIsScary</a><br /> <br /> Lure of the Flames isn't gone, it's just a ritual now. It's one shot a night like D&amp;D but it's the same powers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Imagine going to war to discover your 21st century machinegun has been replaced with a 16th century matchlock. Also your lighter has been confiscated and you've been given two sticks and are told to make it work. <br /> <br /> <br /> The defining feature of Thaumaturgy for those outside the clan was it's versatility; Tremere had a diverse collection of powers, and all the vampires using their static disciplines should be jealous of them and covet this power. Sorcerers themselves are both proud and secretive of their power, and are aware that there's so much more that they don't know. <br /> V5 thaumaturgy doesn't offer that versatility, but is still a lot of work; there's far less reason to covet such a power. Tremere are just nerds with a weird discipline that takes too much effort to use properly. I guess Sorcerers can still be proud of the monumental effort they put into a power that's a little showy. <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> RE VInculum </div> </div> </div>I care<br /> <br /> Also, the idea that all Lasombra 'don't really care' and are just manipulators is yours alone. You recognize this yes? Sure, a lot of the clan would be like that, but they've canonically always had genuine religiosity to them. <br /> <br /> The Lasombra joining the Camarilla would, if we were to use pre-v5 rules, be a ma-hu-sive clusterfuck. 1/2th of the clan would be a realistic estimate only after 8/10ths of the clan in the Sabbat had fucking died. They need to work with or against their pack, they need to work out where to defect to, they have to not get caught, apparently they need to kill an Important sabbat or something which is.. hard to both prove and get away with. They then need to not get killed by the Camarilla and... Yeah. Not to mention there'll be an increase in alertness and paranoia before the clusterfuck of purges ravages everything. <br /> <br /> Build up prestation with Camarilla elders, A quiet defection, some embraces once you're over the fence? That'd work. But that's not how V5 says it happens. <br /> <br /> Concerning Lasombra Antitrubu numbers: I don't think the Sabbat can logistically pull off a large scale progrom against Camarilla Lasombra, especially when they are further from Sabbat territories. The information they need would be hard to acquire and they would risk themselves more than they'd threaten the Antitribu. On the Frontier? Yeah that'd be doable. But not in most cities. Lasombra Antitribu are likely far more threatened by other-camarilla than Sabbat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T12:51:43-07:00","id":1417880,"title":"","content":"to be fair also disliked the idea of Talley defecting to the Camarilla. It seems odd to me that he would defect to the Camarilla which seems counter to how he was portrayed in revised. In that a. Talley is a MONSTER b. in the clan novel anthology he has a whole great scene with Theo Bell where he talks about the horrors of the camarilla and how terrible it is so he should leave. Like Talley in Revised is VERY pro Sabbat. I dunno...I like my Talley in the Sabbat and my Theo Bell in the Camarilla. I think its kind of a disservice to the character to have him be the whipping boy of Vitel (who is anarch) and then join the Camarilla as well. But that's a personal taste thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T13:07:38-07:00","id":1417884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1417879#post1417879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Concerning Lasombra Antitrubu numbers: I don't think the Sabbat can logistically pull off a large scale progrom against Camarilla Lasombra, especially when they are further from Sabbat territories. The information they need would be hard to acquire and they would risk themselves more than they'd threaten the Antitribu. On the Frontier? Yeah that'd be doable. But not in most cities. Lasombra Antitribu are likely far more threatened by other-camarilla than Sabbat.</div> </div> </div> </div>I admit, I've always had a view that the Sabbat was a lot smarter than people gave it credit for. The shovelheads and Mass Embraced psychopaths losing themselves to the Beast were a danger, yes, but before things started to go to hell with the East Coast Crusade, the majority of Sabbat were a lot more subtle than they were reputed to be. How does a Sabbat member infiltrate the Camarilla?<br /> <br /> An Antitribu puts on a nice jacket, walks in to Elysium, introduces himself to the Prince and agrees to bide by the Traditions. He then locates the Lasombra Antitribu and blows up his or her car before slipping out.<br /> <br /> Another lesson: No one betrays the Sword of Caine.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The defining feature of Thaumaturgy for those outside the clan was it's versatility; Tremere had a diverse collection of powers, and all the vampires using their static disciplines should be jealous of them and covet this power. Sorcerers themselves are both proud and secretive of their power, and are aware that there's so much more that they don't know.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno, isn't Thaumaturgy MORE powerful at the 1-5 level now? You can learn Path of Flames, Neptune's Fury, or the Spirit Thaumaturgy Paths just by learning rituals now -- and they don't cost EXP.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperSabbatST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1417880#post1417880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">to be fair also disliked the idea of Talley defecting to the Camarilla. It seems odd to me that he would defect to the Camarilla which seems counter to how he was portrayed in revised. In that a. Talley is a MONSTER b. in the clan novel anthology he has a whole great scene with Theo Bell where he talks about the horrors of the camarilla and how terrible it is so he should leave. Like Talley in Revised is VERY pro Sabbat. I dunno...I like my Talley in the Sabbat and my Theo Bell in the Camarilla. I think its kind of a disservice to the character to have him be the whipping boy of Vitel (who is anarch) and then join the Camarilla as well. But that's a personal taste thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought it was a bit weird myself but I remember that conversation differently than you do. Talley talked to Theo Bell in that bar and he asked, &quot;Do you really believe the bullshit about the sects being different?&quot; Theo Bell saying he did surprised Talley because the implications I got was Talley thought the Sabbat was a JOB, not a vocation.<br /> <br /> To quote Mortal Kombat's Kabal, &quot;The Black Dragon was always more of a gig than a brotherhood.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-12-2020, 04:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T13:15:30-07:00","id":1417888,"title":"","content":"Ya and Talley also summons arms of the abyss to kill the bartender and patrons casually going &quot;Why do you even care about the food?&quot; lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T13:16:29-07:00","id":1417889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperSabbatST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1417888#post1417888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ya and Talley also summons arms of the abyss to kill the bartender and patrons casually going &quot;Why do you even care about the food?&quot; lol</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, that would be a question I suspect many Camarilla members would ask.<br /> <br /> But Theo Bell apparently had a VERY different idea about what the Camarilla was about than your average Elder.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T13:19:16-07:00","id":1417892,"title":"","content":"I dont most Camarilla members would commit casual murder of humans...with them mostly being on humanity and all lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T13:30:13-07:00","id":1417895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperSabbatST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1417892#post1417892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon