rong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418420#post1418420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, I strongly disagree.<br /> <br /> Paths never seemed very well done to me. They listed a bunch of sins and rules but gave very few roleplaying hints as well as a detailed view of their theologies.<br /> <br /> But to each their own.</div> </div> </div> </div>And what we know of cults so far is a card with benefits that eat up backgrounds for social benefits, and come with a funny handshake, yay? Not the fundamental reworking of the morality system into something that actually matters more than the thrice cursed game killing hunger dice (may it melt in eternal fire) Paths tell stories, the cults and hunger flat out don't","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T14:34:29-07:00","id":1418426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418424#post1418424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And I think they should. They should have a book of Blood Cults for each of the Paths.<br /> <br /> We have the Path of Lilith at least covered.<br /> <br /> KINDA, SORTA the Path of Caine but I really wish they'd get more into that.</div> </div> </div> </div>No we don't have lillith covered, we really don't. It's this shallow lifeless thing broken and mutilated to fit the Tenets and touchstones system that do not work for Paths","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T14:35:12-07:00","id":1418427,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418425#post1418425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And what we know of cults so far is a card with benefits that eat up backgrounds for social benefits, and come with a funny handshake, yay? Not the fundamental reworking of the morality system into something that actually matters more than the thrice cursed game killing hunger dice (may it melt in eternal fire) <b>Paths tell stories, the cults and hunger flat out don't</b></div> </div> </div> </div>That's just silly and disingenous.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T14:39:48-07:00","id":1418428,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418427#post1418427\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's just silly and disingenous.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Having made myself watch some streams, and from playing, that is my honest take. The cults as far as my knowledge of them goes are a joke, And hunger is a pox that details sessions, you end up house ruling and ignoring the systems so much you might as well be playing a different game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T14:46:47-07:00","id":1418429,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418428#post1418428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Having made myself watch some streams, and from playing, that is my honest take. The cults as far as my knowledge of them goes are a joke, And hunger is a pox that details sessions, you end up house ruling and ignoring the systems so much you might as well be playing a different game.</div> </div> </div> </div>What, exactly, is a joke about the cults?<br /> <br /> I'm actually serious. They're fascinating insight into the underdeveloped area of Kindred religion and spirituality.<br /> <br /> I love the Church of Set, The Church of Caine is a HUGE part of my games, and I absolutely am fascinated by the Cult of Mithras that played a huge role in my FALL OF LONDON game that is widely considered to be the best thing we've ever run.<br /> <br /> Please tell me which cults you dislike and why.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T15:10:35-07:00","id":1418436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418429#post1418429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What, exactly, is a joke about the cults?<br /> <br /> I'm actually serious. They're fascinating insight into the underdeveloped area of Kindred religion and spirituality.<br /> <br /> I love the Church of Set, The Church of Caine is a HUGE part of my games, and I absolutely am fascinated by the Cult of Mithras that played a huge role in my FALL OF LONDON game that is widely considered to be the best thing we've ever run.<br /> <br /> Please tell me which cults you dislike and why.</div> </div> </div> </div>In general answer as away from my books. They don't change anything, you may RP seeking enlightenment, but you are still on humanity and still have human touchstonez, making it clear no one really beliefs to the extent the Paths managed, you haven't replaced humanity with your cult as your only balwark against the beast, you are simply play acting. Mortals should not be embodying some ideal for you, the focus of the cult should remove that utterly. The doctrines, rituals and goals of the Cult should be all you have and all you need to hold back wassail. But agai this goes against the theme of forced interactions.with humans that runs thru the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-15-2020, 06:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T15:24:00-07:00","id":1418438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418436#post1418436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In general answer as away from my books. They don't change anything, you may RP seeking enlightenment, but you are still on humanity and still have human touchstonez, making it clear no one really beliefs to the extent the Paths managed, you haven't replaced humanity with your cult as your only balwark against the beast, you are simply play acting. Mortals should not be embodying some ideal for you, the focus of the cult should remove that utterly. The doctrines, rituals and goals of the Cult should be all you have and all you need to hold back wassail. But agai this goes against the theme of forced interactions.with humans that runs thru the game.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, it doesn't matter what they wrote about them, it's just the mechanics.<br /> <br /> Just checking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T15:30:45-07:00","id":1418440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418438#post1418438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So, it doesn't matter what they wrote about them, it's just the mechanics.<br /> <br /> Just checking.</div> </div> </div> </div>The mechanics are what allow stories to be told, without that the story falls flat and lifeless, like flesh flensed from.its skeleton. So yea they could be amazingly interesting, ( which I don't recall the ones I have seen being, by the oby) but without systems to support that story, falls flat and becomes an immersion breaking headscratcher like Methuselah are terrifying...well the ones we have seen stated aren't anywhere near capable of the acta they are credited with, and are just slightly more powerful primogen, maybe a dice or 2 different, not these Blood God's walking the planet, so again that is system not supporting story, which is it's only purpose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T15:38:02-07:00","id":1418442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418440#post1418440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The mechanics are what allow stories to be told, without that the story falls flat and lifeless, like flesh flensed from.its skeleton. So yea they could be amazingly interesting, ( which I don't recall the ones I have seen being, by the oby) but without systems to support that story, falls flat and becomes an immersion breaking headscratcher like Methuselah are terrifying...well the ones we have seen stated aren't anywhere near capable of the acta they are credited with, and are just slightly more powerful primogen, maybe a dice or 2 different, not these Blood God's walking the planet, so again that is system not supporting story, which is it's only purpose.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm actually not disputing your opinion on the subject. What works for you works for you and what doesn't, doesn't. It's just a very different attitude for me because I consider the rules less important than the fluff.<br /> <br /> I use them but they take a secondary priority to the Storytelling, especially regarding Humanity and Paths.<br /> <br /> The best written cult in the world won't change your mind and that's fine because the problem is elsewhere and elemental. So, yeah, I understand. Sorry for wasting your time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T15:45:03-07:00","id":1418444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418442#post1418442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm actually not disputing your opinion on the subject. What works for you works for you and what doesn't, doesn't. It's just a very different attitude for me because I consider the rules less important than the fluff.<br /> <br /> I use them but they take a secondary priority to the Storytelling, especially regarding Humanity and Paths.<br /> <br /> The best written cult in the world won't change your mind and that's fine because the problem is elsewhere and elemental. So, yeah, I understand. Sorry for wasting your time.</div> </div> </div> </div>Where as I see them as equal (also recovered Chicago By Night from drive thru just to take a look, and the Lilith cult and cult of Shelim aren't that. Interesting, especially not compare to what the babari used to be) and they are both still stuck to the headscratcher of having to have human morality pets, which for Shelim especially makes zero sense.<br /> <br /> The system is the skeleton and sinew, the story is the meat and muscle, neither functions without the other.<br /> <br /> (Oh asan aside I don't use fluff and crunch after a game design Dev at paizo called people out on it, for making story seem unimportant, that reasoning made sense to me)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-15-2020, 06:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T15:54:46-07:00","id":1418446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418444#post1418444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Where as I see them as equal (also recovered Chicago By Night from drive thru just to take a look, and the Lilith cult and cult of Shelim aren't that. Interesting, especially not compare to what the babari used to be) and they are both still stuck to the headscratcher of having to have human morality pets, which for Shelim especially makes zero sense.<br /> <br /> The system is the skeleton and sinew, the story is the meat and muscle, neither functions without the other.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. Frankly, I think of the Bahari as the worst cult and Path in the entirety of the game. So I have no opinion on them.<br /> <br /> 2. I think of the Rabbi as a fascinating character given his relationship to real life atrocities. He's a guy who is arguing a point of philosophical nihilism and emptiness to deal with the pain of the real world world. I also think he's actually misunderstanding his own religion because I think the Cult of Shalim *IS* a &quot;bwhahahaha, OBLIVION&quot; religion. Except his in-universe points are the kind that &quot;The Conspiracy against the Human Race&quot; and existentialism deal with. He's a fascinating character to talk with if you like philosophy.<br /> <br /> 3. Honestly, I disagree. I will out myself here but I frankly just don't bother ever keeping a tight track of the Humanity or Path score of someone. You lose a point automatically when you deliberately choose to go against your beliegs at a dramatic point. You gain a point when you do something suitably dramatic to your Path and Conviction. What is important is that you roleplay to Humanity or your Path to a way that works, not the rolls.<br /> <br /> More like the video game than the books.<br /> <br /> 3. Eh, as you see with Talley, some vampires don't have Touchstones. He has no Convictions or Touchstone but he gets by fine for the past 800 years.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T15:55:28-07:00","id":1418447,"title":"","content":"It's a shakeup for the sake of a shakeup, and one doesn't have to squint hard to see the metaplot between the end of Revised Edition and the launch of V5 being massaged to make the shakeup happen.<br /> <br /> As a new status quo, I think it's viable. Placing the Lasombra within the Sabbat made initial sense when the clan concept didn't have much flesh on its bones besides being Armand from Interview with the Vampire with the serial numbers filed off, but writers have had decades to develop them into something with its own identity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T21:53:58-07:00","id":1418479,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418446#post1418446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1. Frankly, I think of the Bahari as the worst cult and Path in the entirety of the game. So I have no opinion on them.<br /> <br /> 2. I think of the Rabbi as a fascinating character given his relationship to real life atrocities. He's a guy who is arguing a point of philosophical nihilism and emptiness to deal with the pain of the real world world. I also think he's actually misunderstanding his own religion because I think the Cult of Shalim *IS* a &amp;quot;bwhahahaha, OBLIVION&amp;quot; religion. Except his in-universe points are the kind that &amp;quot;The Conspiracy against the Human Race&amp;quot; and existentialism deal with. He's a fascinating character to talk with if you like philosophy.<br /> <br /> 3. Honestly, I disagree. I will out myself here but I frankly just don't bother ever keeping a tight track of the Humanity or Path score of someone. You lose a point automatically when you deliberately choose to go against your beliegs at a dramatic point. You gain a point when you do something suitably dramatic to your Path and Conviction. What is important is that you roleplay to Humanity or your Path to a way that works, not the rolls.<br /> <br /> More like the video game than the books.<br /> <br /> 3. Eh, as you see with Talley, some vampires don't have Touchstones. He has no Convictions or Touchstone but he gets by fine for the past 800 years.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. Fair enough, I like them as setting flavour, but haven't played one.<br /> <br /> 2. Except, again it hasn't touched his core morality, nor how he deals with the beast, this I agree his Path rating would be pretty low, or he would be on an alternate path in the same movement <br /> <br /> 3. RAW Talley would have wassailed centuries ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T02:44:37-07:00","id":1418496,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25011\" data-vbnamecard=\"25011\">Taggie</a> for your 2. (and 3.) let me quote a certain gaming gentlemen from earlier in this Thread:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1417789#post1417789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you want Paths of Enlightenment, pick up a Conviction and help set your Chronicle Tenets. It's really that easy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it is fascinating how people get hung up on the word &quot;humanity&quot;. With the quote and what cult shows us in mind, I read the stat &quot;humanity&quot; as more than just the old rev. Path of Humanity and more like a core concept that is opposed to the beast. Therefore to me the whole &quot;you have humanity ergo you have to be a good person or go wassail&quot; is like saying &quot;you have strengh 4 so you have to look like the Rock&quot;.<br /> <br /> You get Stains by breaking you chronicle Tenets or your Convictions. And this is where the quote comes in. You wanna play full out shovelhead Sabbat &quot;kill em all and let God sort them out&quot;? Set your Tents and Convictions the right way and you\u00b4re good to go.<br /> Your party wants to go on that humanity hippie trip? Not that big of a problem either since &quot;If the Tenet was violated in the service of a Conviction, reduce the Stains gained by one or more.&quot; (Core p.239) Note: it does not say you get at least one, so you can reduce Stains from Tenets to 0 by upholding your Convictions.<br /> In order to get something like a Path from the Cults book one would need something like sample Convictions for each cult... which they give you. So cults are not just fluff and 3 more Powers, they actually tell you how to (moraly) play them and get away with it.<br /> <br /> But then, there are Touchstones. And this can be a pain in the butt, I give you that. If you dont want to give your Vampire a loyal servant whom he does not hate (you dont need to love yout Touchstone), you would need to emulate something like the Loresheet/Bloodline Haringers of Ashur 1. This one lets you take a corpse as your Touchstone. For my games, I made a Loresheet Paths of Enlightenment with a loot of goodies. The first Point is, that you can take non human Touchstones (e.g. a Book, your favourite Sword, etc.). Or you just talk to your ST and ask him to not give you a Touchstone.<br /> <br /> tl:dr<br /> Paths are already possible with the current Humanity System, they may need a little dabbling with Touchstones.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T05:53:29-07:00","id":1418508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418442#post1418442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm actually not disputing your opinion on the subject. What works for you works for you and what doesn't, doesn't. It's just a very different attitude for me because I consider the rules less important than the fluff.<br /> <br /> I use them but they take a secondary priority to the Storytelling, especially regarding Humanity and Paths.<br /> <br /> The best written cult in the world won't change your mind and that's fine because the problem is elsewhere and elemental. So, yeah, I understand. Sorry for wasting your time.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with you about the importance of fluff/story versus mechanics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T06:19:22-07:00","id":1418515,"title":"","content":"Some ideas for Sabbat games:<br /> <br /> Sample Tenets<br /> - Never betray your pack<br /> - Acting like you're still human<br /> - Never fall to Frenzy<br /> <br /> Choose a Path, pick up to three Convictions based on the Ethics and/or Hierarchy of Sins. For each Conviction, one Packmate counts as a Touchstone (these should be the ones you have highest Vinculum rating for). As Vinculums change, so do your Touchstones. Treat these Packmates as Touchstones in all ways regarding rules for human Touchstones.<br /> <br /> I don't see any problems in playing Sabbat with the new V5 rules. Heck, you got examples of Auctoritas in Cults under the Church of Caine that return Willpower, so you really don't need Touchstones either. As for the Lasombra leaving... Good riddance. It's time for the Sabbat to cut the dead weight and get busy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","name":"PJ123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T07:02:35-07:00","id":1418521,"title":"","content":"Cult of the Blood gods.. I've skimmed through some of it. <br /> <br /> On it's own, it works for describing some cults. it certainly lacks the nuance and understanding of earlier works. Like there's a writeup for the church of set that does the hows but it doesn't do the whys at all. Maybe I'm Biased because some things that have existed for a while and got changed for no reason, and the changes don't seem to be improvements. I mean the Bahari went from an S+M cult to... an S cult? <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">Also I didn't realise influencers were so relevant before i read this text. Their inclusion seems so... bitter. </span><br /> <br /> Paths of Enlightenment are simple. Many I have issues with (seriously some of them are suicidal) but I like that they are succinct and evocative. CotBG.... There's a lot of waffle. So many words for such little meaning. But also, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12002_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12002\" data-vbnamecard=\"12002\">CTPhipps</a> you've got to understand that <i>Cults</i> is not offering Paths of Enlightenment. Paths of Enlightenment were a complete moral reorientation that individual Cainites set themselves upon. Cults are social clubs for losers, and it leans more towards one-true-wayism for humanity as a result. Roads&gt;&gt;Paths&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;Cults. I mean most of the 'cults' I'm familiar with don't even have good convictions. Also do we still need people around to have these convictions? <br /> <br /> Also, the cult of Shalim seems like another -fuck the Lasombra- move. A Methuselah with -NotRepresentedByTheGame'sMechanics- power can just... turn Lasombra into evil dudes whether they like it or not? I'd welcome an abyssal cult, but this one is not the one. Nights, Power and the inner voice, Chivalry, Cathari, Caine, Textbook humanity... and the rememberance of the road of heaven. The Lasombra were awesome and diverse. CotBG... there's some good stuff there, but much of it is a disservice. <br /> <br /> Also the Camarilla being Secretly-Religious was great, and then they've gone made it overt and.... I feel the motivations behind this move are suspect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T07:07:19-07:00","id":1418522,"title":"","content":"The Sabbat is not a monolitich religion, is made of several sub cults, and paths may differ a lot when it comes to core ethics and tenents. Religious conflict between pack members was a big thing of Sabbat's games.<br /> <br /> Just to make an example, let's take the 3 tenets proposed<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> - Never betray your pack </div> </div> </div>No good for Path of the Inner Voice, Metamorphosis and Path of the Night<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> - Acting like you're still human </div> </div> </div>No good for Honorable Accord, Harmony and Redemption path<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> - Never fall to Frenzy </div> </div> </div>No good for Path of Orion ,Night and Redemption<br /> <br /> <br /> That's the point, there is no common ground between Paths, nothing that the &quot;one size fit all&quot; of the tenets could fill.<br /> Frenzy is a big problem if you are a Cathari, a Noddist or a Necronomist, but it's not a big deal for the followers of the Path of Night or for the followers of the path of Redemption. Betraying your pack is a big taboo if you are on the Path of Honorable Accord, but it is mandatory for vampires on the Path of the Inner Voice or the Path of the Night. Killing humans without reason is good if you are on the path of the Death and the Soul , but it's a big no no if you are on the Path of Caine<br /> <br /> In my current Sabbat campaign I have two players on the Path of Harmony, one on the Path of Metamorphosis, one on the Path of Inner Voice and two on Humanity.<br /> Can I do this with V5?<br /> No, I can't. Otherwise just show me tenets that can work for these Paths/Humanity put together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 10-16-2020, 11:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T07:55:18-07:00","id":1418528,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1417789#post1417789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1)f you want Paths of Enlightenment, pick up a Conviction and help set your Chronicle Tenets. It's really that easy. If you want a moral paragon of an Abyss Mystic, who doesn't lose Humanity while they play with the stuff of entropy, you're talking about such a character contradiction that that character deserves what's coming to them. 2)Abyss Mysticism is close to infernalism in its unholy nature. Of course it drains your Humanity.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 1) tried that, it flat out feels nothing like being on a Path, it just doesn't function. Not involved enough, not enough space for conflict between tenets of the Path, no mechanical support for morality checks. and no or minimal shared Tenets between paths to make Chronicle tenets with. 2) Which would matter if I wanted a vampire on the Path of Humanity, I don't, they are dull and uninteresting to me, sorry just don't care about Cam and anarch morality, and woe is me self loathing, vampires are transcendent super predators, that is what interests me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-16-2020, 11:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T07:58:19-07:00","id":1418529,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PJ123</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418515#post1418515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some ideas for Sabbat games:<br /> <br /> Sample Tenets<br /> - Never betray your pack<br /> - Acting like you're still human<br /> - Never fall to Frenzy<br /> <br /> Choose a Path, pick up to three Convictions based on the Ethics and/or Hierarchy of Sins. For each Conviction, one Packmate counts as a Touchstone (these should be the ones you have highest Vinculum rating for). As Vinculums change, so do your Touchstones. Treat these Packmates as Touchstones in all ways regarding rules for human Touchstones.<br /> <br /> I don't see any problems in playing Sabbat with the new V5 rules. Heck, you got examples of Auctoritas in Cults under the Church of Caine that return Willpower, so you really don't need Touchstones either. As for the Lasombra leaving... Good riddance. It's time for the Sabbat to cut the dead weight and get busy.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Power and the Inner Voice laughs hard at the first 2, as do Death and The Soul, Metamorphosis and Night, and nearly all Sabbat paths laugh at the third, have you never heard of Riding the Wave?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T09:01:50-07:00","id":1418534,"title":"","content":"Undead Rabbit, you gave three Paths for each Tenet showing a problem. That's good. Conflict = good story. Convictions help offset Tenet violations. It's not supposed to be easy being a paragon of a Path or Humanity. Otherwise, just have the Tenet Failing to Do Whatever I Want and be done with it.<br /> <br /> Taggie, originally I was going to write Failing to resist Frenzy or Ride the Wave, but felt the word count was too high. \ud83d\ude0a","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","name":"PJ123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T10:01:09-07:00","id":1418541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PJ123</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418534#post1418534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Undead Rabbit, you gave three Paths for each Tenet showing a problem. That's good. Conflict = good story. Convictions help offset Tenet violations. It's not supposed to be easy being a paragon of a Path or Humanity. Otherwise, just have the Tenet Failing to Do Whatever I Want and be done with it.<br /> <br /> Taggie, originally I was going to write Failing to resist Frenzy or Ride the Wave, but felt the word count was too high. \ud83d\ude0a</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So punishing people for following their path is good? How the heck does that work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T10:22:02-07:00","id":1418545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418541#post1418541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So punishing people for following their path is good? How the heck does that work?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds like the &quot;But I'm just roleplaying my character!&quot; excuse.<br /> <br /> I actually have problems with the lack of material for Humanity, Ambition, Touchstones, and Convictions but you don't actually seem to know how to run decent Chronicle Tenets.<br /> <br /> You sound like you have some shit players if they chose Tenets at odds with the Chronicle's own.<br /> <br /> The whole point of Chronicle Tenets is to have a harmonous consistent tone with the game you want to play.<br /> <br /> I.e. &quot;Don't kill the innocent&quot; for a typical morality game versus, say, &quot;Denying your freedom&quot; for a Sabbat Loyalist game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T10:40:21-07:00","id":1418549,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418545#post1418545\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sounds like the &quot;But I'm just roleplaying my character!&quot; excuse.<br /> <br /> I actually have problems with the lack of material for Humanity, Ambition, Touchstones, and Convictions but you don't actually seem to know how to run decent Chronicle Tenets.<br /> <br /> You sound like you have some shit players if they chose Tenets at odds with the Chronicle's own.<br /> <br /> The whole point of Chronicle Tenets is to have a harmonous consistent tone with the game you want to play.<br /> <br /> I.e. &quot;Don't kill the innocent&quot; for a typical morality game versus, say, &quot;Denying your freedom&quot; for a Sabbat Loyalist game.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No, we have player (Well had, people have mostly given up on WoD) people who wanted to pick a character and play them ,conflicts and all, what is being suggested here makes that impossible. Either have morality as the 100% internal thing it is, or don't bother. Do not enforce a straight jacket called Tenets<br /> <br /> Also, outside session 0/fade to black boundaries... I am just playing my character is a 100% valid excuse, that can also get that character killed by his pack mates, more than once, with dawning horror I have realised that a Path or Character requires me to do something, I as a player find head desk stupid....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-16-2020, 01:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T10:42:40-07:00","id":1418551,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418549#post1418549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, we have player (Well had, people have mostly given up on WoD) people who wanted to pick a character and play them ,conflicts and all, what is being suggested here makes that impossible. Either have morality as the 100% internal thing it is, or don't bother. Do not enforce a straight jacket called Tenets</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's a guard against disruptive play. If you're going to start a game where you are going to inflict Humanity loss for killing guards in self-defense then your players need to know this.<br /> <br /> The Chronicle Tenets gets everyone on the same page as to what sort of game they're going to run.<br /> <br /> If a guy plans to run around killing humans casually in a game full of Angel and Nick Knight types, it's not going to be fun for anyone.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T10:51:40-07:00","id":1418552,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418551#post1418551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think it's a guard against disruptive play. If you're going to start a game where you are going to inflict Humanity loss for killing guards in self-defense then your players need to know this.<br /> <br /> The Chronicle Tenets gets everyone on the same page as to what sort of game they're going to run.<br /> <br /> If a guy plans to run around killing humans casually in a game full of Angel and Nick Knight types, it's not going to be fun for anyone.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> But, again, you can't have a Sabbat game with the Tenets that keep being suggested, because they conflict with the Paths (you also can't do the paths properly with 3 convictions but that is another problem). (For example the bare minimum for Path of Caine: Consume the Cainites who feign humanity, Ride the wave of frenzy, Seek lore of caine, Honour other Students of caines Mysteries, Test yourself to your limits, Humans are cattle, treat them as such. Even that is probably to pared down, but you get the idea)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-16-2020, 01:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T11:32:01-07:00","id":1418560,"title":"","content":"I get the impression you missunderstand what Tenets are and what makes them different to Convictions. Tenets are the moral Groundrules. They dont have to be part of your Path, they just should not go hard against them.<br /> Then there are Convictions, you own moral Rules. Those things you wrote as the Path of Caine. From a roleplay perspective you should follow them all, from a rule perspective you have to think about the 1-3 most important. The ones you should be punished for breaking.<br /> Again, if you break Tenets for the sake of Convicitons, you can mitigate Stains.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T12:14:06-07:00","id":1418565,"title":"","content":"In my opinion, the only thing holding the Sabbat together are the bonds of Vinculum. Their whole philosophy of vampiric supremacy runs counter to working with other Licks that, when you get down to the brass tacks, are competition for your food. Tenets, as others said, set the tone. Dont betray your pack, acting like a human, falling to Frenzy will be different from denying your Beast, treating humans as equal, not supporting your pack. There may be some overlap, but it's going to run different.<br /> <br /> I always saw the original Creation Rites as a sort mystically induced, personality breakdown similar to how boot camps do it (but occurring in one night of digging out of the grave, vice 8-16 weeks). Before you can build a good Sailor, Soldier, Airman, Marine, you must break them down and then rebuild them how you want. Not everyone makes it (not every Sabbat survives Creation Rites). As you progress in the military, you may be subject to further trials that break you down to build you up how the unit needs you. Paths form a similar function.<br /> <br /> The Creation Rites break down your Humanity so you can be built up as a proper Sabbat. The original description in the 2E Player Guide mentioned the more you gave in to your Humanity loss, the easier it got to dig out. Kinda went off on a tangent here, my apologies.<br /> <br /> In a mixed Path pack, there will always be conflict. Whether you have V5 Tenets or the old rules. Some of the Paths do not work well together (it's why the Black Hand is selective in who they recruit). And, to bring it back to my starting point, it's why the Sabbat has Vinculums. Without some kind of mystical enforcement, the Sabbat would rip itself apart.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","name":"PJ123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T12:30:56-07:00","id":1418568,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PJ123</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418565#post1418565\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my opinion, the only thing holding the Sabbat together are the bonds of Vinculum. Their whole philosophy of vampiric supremacy runs counter to working with other Licks that, when you get down to the brass tacks, are competition for your food. Tenets, as others said, set the tone. Dont betray your pack, acting like a human, falling to Frenzy will be different from denying your Beast, treating humans as equal, not supporting your pack. There may be some overlap, but it's going to run different.<br /> <br /> I always saw the original Creation Rites as a sort mystically induced, personality breakdown similar to how boot camps do it (but occurring in one night of digging out of the grave, vice 8-16 weeks). Before you can build a good Sailor, Soldier, Airman, Marine, you must break them down and then rebuild them how you want. Not everyone makes it (not every Sabbat survives Creation Rites). As you progress in the military, you may be subject to further trials that break you down to build you up how the unit needs you. Paths form a similar function.<br /> <br /> The Creation Rites break down your Humanity so you can be built up as a proper Sabbat. The original description in the 2E Player Guide mentioned the more you gave in to your Humanity loss, the easier it got to dig out. Kinda went off on a tangent here, my apologies.<br /> <br /> In a mixed Path pack, there will always be conflict. Whether you have V5 Tenets or the old rules. Some of the Paths do not work well together (it's why the Black Hand is selective in who they recruit). And, to bring it back to my starting point, it's why the Sabbat has Vinculums. Without some kind of mystical enforcement, the Sabbat would rip itself apart.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> But that lack of working together should not trigger degeneration, that is the point. That core conflict between paths should not be punished.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T12:32:03-07:00","id":1418569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TakeoChan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418560#post1418560\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I get the impression you missunderstand what Tenets are and what makes them different to Convictions. Tenets are the moral Groundrules. They dont have to be part of your Path, they just should not go hard against them.<br /> Then there are Convictions, you own moral Rules. Those things you wrote as the Path of Caine. From a roleplay perspective you should follow them all, from a rule perspective you have to think about the 1-3 most important. The ones you should be punished for breaking.<br /> Again, if you break Tenets for the sake of Convicitons, you can mitigate Stains.</div> </div> </div> </div>]<br /> <br /> Following your path should not be punished. That is my point, it is the core identity of the character, NOT following it should cause degeneration. Morality and self control are internal conflicts, and should be played as such. Which is my point really if you want paths to work, you cannot have Tenets, and need at least half a dozen convictions without touchstones.<br /> <br /> Following the Path having in game consequences is fine, having it cause degeneration is not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-16-2020, 03:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T12:52:28-07:00","id":1418572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418569#post1418569\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">]<br /> <br /> Following your path should not be punished. That is my point, it is the core identity of the character, NOT following it should cause degeneration. Morality and self control are internal conflicts, and should be played as such. Which is my point really if you want paths to work, you cannot have Tenets, and need at least half a dozen convictions without touchstones.<br /> <br /> Following the Path having in game consequences is fine, having it cause degeneration is not.</div> </div> </div> </div>But following you Path is not per se punished. Your Convictions are your Path. If you dont follow them, you get Stains. Its as simple as that. The Touchstones are a little problematic, depending on your concept, I give you that.<br /> You can have Tenets and Paths. A Path is something personal, Tenets are group rules. If you choose Tents that you Character breaks constantly, you have choosen the wrong Tenets. They are Rules for your Group, Tenets set the mood of the game. They can be as humane or as monstrous as you want.<br /> If your group sets the Tenet &quot;Dont kill safe for self defense&quot; and you play a murder-hobo... wrong Character for that group<br /> If your group wants to play murder-hobos and sets that Tenets... wrong Tenet for that group.<br /> <br /> Lets say your group finds Tenets and like 90% of the time theres no problem with the Tenets and your Path. The other 10% of the time, your Convictions (your Path) can mitigate the Stains, even neutralise them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T12:55:42-07:00","id":1418573,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TakeoChan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418572#post1418572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But following you Path is not per se punished. Your Convictions are your Path. If you dont follow them, you get Stains. Its as simple as that. The Touchstones are a little problematic, depending on your concept, I give you that.<br /> You can have Tenets and Paths. A Path is something personal, Tenets are group rules. If you choose Tents that you Character breaks constantly, you have choosen the wrong Tenets. They are Rules for your Group, Tenets set the mood of the game. They can be as humane or as monstrous as you want.<br /> If your group sets the Tenet &quot;Dont kill safe for self defense&quot; and you play a murder-hobo... wrong Character for that group<br /> If your group wants to play murder-hobos and sets that Tenets... wrong Tenet for that group.<br /> <br /> Lets say your group finds Tenets and like 90% of the time theres no problem with the Tenets and your Path. The other 10% of the time, your Convictions (your Path) can mitigate the Stains, even neutralise them.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> then that 10% the Tenets are punishing the character. IF the tenet ever becomes involved in following the characters path it has failed as a concept and as a system. It should never become involved in a characters path. So people suggesting loyalty to Pack or Sect, that's a fail, for instance, Never fall to frenzy, again a fail, The Path is the be all and end all measuring a characters personal morality and ethics. That's it, in totality, nothing else matters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-16-2020, 04:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T13:04:21-07:00","id":1418574,"title":"","content":"The thing with tennets and a sabbat game is thus:<br /> <br /> Cults do not necessarily fit the whole party, so they often do not work as chronicle tenets. Yet, if everyone's got their own cult convictions, then there's a lot of haggle that needs to happen. Generally, you want to avoid haggle. Not only do cult members need to work with the storyteller, they also need to work with eachother.<br /> <br /> Paths, they're simpler. You just need to know the tone of the game and take one. They're in nice, neat little packages.<br /> But like, in general, you've got to haggle for so much in V5. It's so over complicated. Individual discipline choices, convictions, loresheets, you'll maybe get weird with predator types...<br /> <br /> Also, paths were stronger. Like, convictions just slow degeneration. Paths actually completely stop degeneration or even reward you for acts heinous to humanity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T13:06:59-07:00","id":1418575,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418574#post1418574\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing with tennets and a sabbat game is thus:<br /> <br /> Cults do not necessarily fit the whole party, so they often do not work as chronicle tenets. Yet, if everyone's got their own cult convictions, then there's a lot of haggle that needs to happen. Generally, you want to avoid haggle. Not only do cult members need to work with the storyteller, they also need to work with eachother.<br /> <br /> Paths, they're simpler. You just need to know the tone of the game and take one. They're in nice, neat little packages.<br /> But like, in general, you've got to haggle for so much in V5. It's so over complicated. Individual discipline choices, convictions, loresheets, you'll maybe get weird with predator types...<br /> <br /> Also, paths were stronger. Like, convictions just slow degeneration. Paths actually completely stop degeneration or even reward you for acts heinous to humanity.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Originally they even had their own versions of Golconda...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T13:09:40-07:00","id":1418576,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TakeoChan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418572#post1418572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But following you Path is not per se punished. Your Convictions are your Path. If you dont follow them, you get Stains. Its as simple as that. The Touchstones are a little problematic, depending on your concept, I give you that.<br /> You can have Tenets and Paths. A Path is something personal, Tenets are group rules. If you choose Tents that you Character breaks constantly, you have choosen the wrong Tenets. They are Rules for your Group, Tenets set the mood of the game. They can be as humane or as monstrous as you want.<br /> If your group sets the Tenet &quot;Dont kill safe for self defense&quot; and you play a murder-hobo... wrong Character for that group<br /> If your group wants to play murder-hobos and sets that Tenets... wrong Tenet for that group.<br /> <br /> Lets say your group finds Tenets and like 90% of the time theres no problem with the Tenets and your Path. The other 10% of the time, your Convictions (your Path) can mitigate the Stains, even neutralise them.</div> </div> </div> </div>My players are the right players for my campaign, and we have no problem with inter-character conflict. There is no problem with some being humans and some being monsters, it's part of the story, and it doesn't hinder anything.<br /> So I ask again: which are the Tenets that allow me to storytell a Sabbat campaign with 2 Sabbat on Humanity, 2 on Harmony, 1 with Power of the Inner Voice, and a Metamorphist?<br /> And this is not an hypotetical scenario, this is the crew I'm mastering now, without problems and with a lot of fun.<br /> So, 3 Tenets that works for all of them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 10-16-2020, 04:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T13:15:09-07:00","id":1418577,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418573#post1418573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> then that 10% the Tenets are punishing the character. IF the tenet ever becomes involved in following the characters path it has failed as a concept and as a system. It should never become involved in a characters path. So people suggesting loyalty to Pack or Sect, that's a fail, for instance,</div> </div> </div> </div>I get the feeling we talk past each other. IF you dont want Tenets that get involved with a characters path, take them accordingly. And no, I cant give you the 3 Tenets that will fix your problems, I dont know your group, your chronicle and your characters.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T13:17:51-07:00","id":1418578,"title":"","content":"So I cannot replicate my current Montreal by Night campaign with V5 rules, you agree?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T13:18:24-07:00","id":1418579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TakeoChan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418577#post1418577\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I get the feeling we talk past each other. IF you dont want Tenets that get involved with a characters path, take them accordingly. And no, I cant give you the 3 Tenets that will fix your problems, I dont know your group, your chronicle and your characters.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Theirs also the bare minimum of 6 convictions issue (at least for Path of Caine, some may get by with less)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T13:19:33-07:00","id":1418580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418574#post1418574\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing with tennets and a sabbat game is thus:<br /> <br /> Cults do not necessarily fit the whole party, so they often do not work as chronicle tenets. Yet, if everyone's got their own cult convictions, then there's a lot of haggle that needs to happen. Generally, you want to avoid haggle. Not only do cult members need to work with the storyteller, they also need to work with eachother.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would rather agree with you, but mind you: Cults are not Paths.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Paths, they're simpler. You just need to know the tone of the game and take one. They're in nice, neat little packages.<br /> But like, in general, you've got to haggle for so much in V5. It's so over complicated. Individual discipline choices, convictions, loresheets, you'll maybe get weird with predator types...<br /> <br /> Also, paths were stronger. Like, convictions just slow degeneration. Paths actually completely stop degeneration or even reward you for acts heinous to humanity. </div> </div> </div>Then again: it is as simple as that. You need to know the tone of the game? Thats you Tenets. You need to take a Path? Choose three Rules accordingly. Thats it. They dont slow degeneration. They top it. At least just as good as humanity does...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T14:13:29-07:00","id":1418585,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TakeoChan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418496#post1418496\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25011\" data-vbnamecard=\"25011\">Taggie</a> for your 2. (and 3.) let me quote a certain gaming gentlemen from earlier in this Thread:<br /> <br /> <br /> I think it is fascinating how people get hung up on the word &quot;humanity&quot;. With the quote and what cult shows us in mind, I read the stat &quot;humanity&quot; as more than just the old rev. Path of Humanity and more like a core concept that is opposed to the beast. Therefore to me the whole &quot;you have humanity ergo you have to be a good person or go wassail&quot; is like saying &quot;you have strengh 4 so you have to look like the Rock&quot;.<br /> <br /> You get Stains by breaking you chronicle Tenets or your Convictions. And this is where the quote comes in. You wanna play full out shovelhead Sabbat &quot;kill em all and let God sort them out&quot;? Set your Tents and Convictions the right way and you\u00b4re good to go.<br /> Your party wants to go on that humanity hippie trip? Not that big of a problem either since &quot;If the Tenet was violated in the service of a Conviction, reduce the Stains gained by one or more.&quot; (Core p.239) Note: it does not say you get at least one, so you can reduce Stains from Tenets to 0 by upholding your Convictions.<br /> In order to get something like a Path from the Cults book one would need something like sample Convictions for each cult... which they give you. So cults are not just fluff and 3 more Powers, they actually tell you how to (moraly) play them and get away with it.<br /> <br /> But then, there are Touchstones. And this can be a pain in the butt, I give you that. If you dont want to give your Vampire a loyal servant whom he does not hate (you dont need to love yout Touchstone), you would need to emulate something like the Loresheet/Bloodline Haringers of Ashur 1. This one lets you take a corpse as your Touchstone. For my games, I made a Loresheet Paths of Enlightenment with a loot of goodies. The first Point is, that you can take non human Touchstones (e.g. a Book, your favourite Sword, etc.). Or you just talk to your ST and ask him to not give you a Touchstone.<br /> <br /> tl:dr<br /> Paths are already possible with the current Humanity System, they may need a little dabbling with Touchstones.</div> </div> </div> </div>I get 'hung up' on the word humanity, because it is as important to me as of they had decided vampires actually drained mana not blood or suddenly didn't burn in sunlight, it is that important. If the system does not, RAW replace Humanity with Path ratings, then what I liked about the system and setting is gone.<br /> <br /> And as I have playtested 3 convictions does not work for Paths (hell imo it doesn't work for Humanity either). Tenets certainly don't work either, under any circumstances.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-16-2020, 05:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T14:25:54-07:00","id":1418586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418576#post1418576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My players are the right players for my campaign, and we have no problem with inter-character conflict. There is no problem with some being humans and some being monsters, it's part of the story, and it doesn't hinder anything.<br /> So I ask again: which are the Tenets that allow me to storytell a Sabbat campaign with 2 Sabbat on Humanity, 2 on Harmony, 1 with Power of the Inner Voice, and a Metamorphist?<br /> And this is not an hypotetical scenario, this is the crew I'm mastering now, without problems and with a lot of fun.<br /> So, 3 Tenets that works for all of them?</div> </div> </div> </div>1. Be your own, never submit<br /> 2. Demand the Respect you are owed<br /> 3. Do not snitch<br /> <br /> 3. Depends on your understanding of &quot;emotions&quot; but can be viable<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T14:32:17-07:00","id":1418587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418579#post1418579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Theirs also the bare minimum of 6 convictions issue (at least for Path of Caine, some may get by with less)</div> </div> </div> </div>Take the 3 most important for your Character and roleplay the rest. Or speak with your ST and take more than 3. I dont quite get the problem with that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418585#post1418585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I get 'hung up' on the word humanity, because it is as important to me as of they had decided vampires actually drained mana not blood or suddenly didn't burn in sunlight, it is that important. If the system does not, RAW replace Humanity with Path ratings, then what I liked about the system and setting is gone.<br /> <br /> And as I have playtested 3 convictions does not work for Paths (hell imo it doesn't work for Humanity either). Tenets certainly don't work either, under any circumstances.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> My point with the word &quot;Humanity&quot; was, that you dont need to replace it with &quot;Paths&quot;, since it already inherets them. Humanity in v5, at least to my understanding, is defined as &quot;everything not the beast&quot;. If you keep your beast in check by planting flowers, cuddling kittens and giving out free candy, thats more like the old humanity. If you keep your beast in check by killing those filthy mortals, that is humanity too. The new System does not need to replace a word on your sheet, it gives you the freedom to define your own way how to keep the beast in check.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26305,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","user":"TakeoChan","date":". 10-16-2020, 05:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T14:37:16-07:00","id":1418589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TakeoChan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418586#post1418586\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1. Be your own, never submit<br /> 2. Demand the Respect you are owed<br /> 3. Do not snitch</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Not good for Inner Voice.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 1. Be your own, never submit </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table_article-table\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_article-table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">9</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Treating your underlings poorly.</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_article-table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">8</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Failing to respect your superiors.</td> </tr> </table></div> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 3. Do not snitch </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table_article-table\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_article-table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">3</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Not using the most effective tool for control.</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Power must be seized. Be iron-fisted and resolute.</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_article-table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_article-table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Turning down an opportunity for power.</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Personal power is the means to all ends.</td> </tr> </table></div> <br /> <br /> And actually, not good even for the Path of Harmony, since an Harmonist must submit to and respect stronger vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 10-16-2020, 05:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T14:41:50-07:00","id":1418591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TakeoChan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418587#post1418587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Take the 3 most important for your Character and roleplay the rest. Or speak with your ST and take more than 3. I dont quite get the problem with that.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> My point with the word &quot;Humanity&quot; was, that you dont need to replace it with &quot;Paths&quot;, since it already inherets them. Humanity in v5, at least to my understanding, is defined as &quot;everything not the beast&quot;. If you keep your beast in check by planting flowers, cuddling kittens and giving out free candy, thats more like the old humanity. If you keep your beast in check by killing those filthy mortals, that is humanity too. The new System does not need to replace a word on your sheet, it gives you the freedom to define your own way how to keep the beast in check.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hard, unbending disagree, if you are on Humanity you are not on a path and I have no interest in playing with a humanity score. Any more than I want to play a vampire who drains mana and doesn't burn in sunlight. It could be the best interpretation of the paths ever written, yet if it still had a humanity score, it gets a hard pass.<br /> <br /> Also I stripped path of caine back to it's bare bones and still had 6 , as I play online mostly, having to play the ST may I ever Chronicle, with people I may not know, isn't a solution, I can only count on RAW.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-16-2020, 05:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T14:49:43-07:00","id":1418594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418589#post1418589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Not good for Inner Voice.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table_article-table\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_article-table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">9</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Treating your underlings poorly.</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_article-table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">8</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Failing to respect your superiors.</td> </tr> </table></div> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table_article-table\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_article-table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">3</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Not using the most effective tool for control.</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Power must be seized. Be iron-fisted and resolute.</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_article-table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_article-table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Turning down an opportunity for power.</td> <td class=\"text_table_article-table_td\">Personal power is the means to all ends.</td> </tr> </table></div> <br /> <br /> And actually, not good even for the Path of Harmony, since an Harmonist must submit to and respect stronger vampires.</div> </div> </div> </div>for 1: why cant you treat your underlings good if you have to be your own? the conviction is not &quot;be an asshole&quot;. Same with respect. You can stand your ground and also show respect to others...<br /> <br /> for the third: okay I that one is not optimal, my mistake.<br /> <br /> then again, I wont go on on this chase to find you the perfect Tenets for your group. As this shows, even the understanding of what a conviction/Tenet means can differ. Thats why you have to talk to your ST about them. In this example I took the first things that came to my mind, and to my understanding 2/3 worked. If you dont want to invest the work and find a third one, fine, be my guest and dont play with Tenets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T14:51:04-07:00","id":1418595,"title":"","content":"So you agree that with the tools of V5 you can't find proper tenets for my campaign and it's easier to play Sabbat with the old rules?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T14:53:06-07:00","id":1418596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418591#post1418591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hard, unbending disagree, if you are on Humanity you are not on a path and I have no interest in playing with a humanity score. Any more than I want to play a vampire who drains mana and doesn't burn in sunlight. It could be the best interpretation of the paths ever written, yet if it still had a humanity score, it gets a hard pass.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well if the problem realy is, that there is the word &quot;humanity&quot; on your sheet, lets spare us the dance and just agree to disagree. Every solution from this point onwards wouldnt be productive.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T14:54:06-07:00","id":1418597,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TakeoChan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418596#post1418596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well if the problem realy is, that there is the word &amp;quot;humanity&amp;quot; on your sheet, lets spare us the dance and just agree to disagree. Every solution from this point onwards wouldnt be productive.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T14:58:55-07:00","id":1418598,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418595#post1418595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So you agree that with the tools of V5 you can't find proper tenets for my campaign and it's easier to play Sabbat with the old rules?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope I just said i dont have the time and energy to work out Tenets for you and your group. I dont think its easier to play Sabbat with the old rules, it just is a different approach. Tenets and Convictions give you the chance to show your take on the WoD and your own understanding on a Path/Humanity. If you want a more individual take on that, V5 in my opinion is better for the job. If you want a nice table and every follower of a certain Path has to follow the exact same rule to the letter,an older version might be better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T15:04:11-07:00","id":1418599,"title":"","content":"So in one case to play my montreal campaign I should haggle and barter for hours with the players to find common tenets, and then again to find common ground about the meaning of the tenets, and in the other case I should just ask &quot;what's your paths?&quot; and check the hierarchies of sins. And the last method it's not easier...<br /> I mean, you just said it: you <u>don't have the time and energy to work out tenets</u>, so it's not as easy as... I don't know... just opening a page of Chaining the Beast, and check.<br /> Right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 10-16-2020, 06:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T15:09:22-07:00","id":1418600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418599#post1418599\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So in one case to play my montreal campaign I should haggle and barter for hours with the players to find common tenets, and then haggling and bartering to find common ground about the meaning of the tenets, and in one case I should just ask &quot;what's your paths?&quot; and check the hierarchy of sins. And the last method it's not easier.<br /> I mean, you just said: you don't have the time and energy to work out tenets. While on the other ground, what I must do is just opening a page of Chaining the Beast, and check.<br /> Right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, since I\u00b4m growing tired of this: Yes it easier to take a standard size suit and hope it fits everybody. The world I as an ST with its underlying morals dont show yours? tough luck. Out of the available Paths nothing is the one that fits perfectly? well just take the least bad one.<br /> Again: You want an individual take on Paths and Chronicles: V5<br /> You want codified tables? not V5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T15:10:15-07:00","id":1418601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Ok, since I\u00b4m growing tired of this: Yes it easier to take a standard size suit and hope it fits everybody </div> </div> </div>Then...give me 3 tenets. You know the morality of the players, it should not be difficult.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T15:12:31-07:00","id":1418602,"title":"","content":"If it makes you happy, whatever man.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T15:13:49-07:00","id":1418603,"title":"","content":"Thanks, you proved my point: the Storyteller doesn't have the wide tools he had before, and you must show the door to a player who doesn't fit your tenets.<br /> So it's harder to put a group together at a table and play a Sabbat campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T15:19:30-07:00","id":1418605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418603#post1418603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks, you proved my point: the Storyteller doesn't have the wide tools he had before, and you must show the door to a player who doesn't fit your tenets.<br /> So it's harder to put a group together at a table and play a Sabbat campaign.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thats... exactly the opposite of what I said. First of all, those are not MY Tenets. Tenets are choosen by the group. So I must &quot;show the door&quot; to a player that doesnt fit his own Tenets.<br /> As an ST I have the same tools (more or less) than before. A player does not abide the rules of morality THEY choose for themself, they risk degeneration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T15:26:01-07:00","id":1418606,"title":"","content":"you guys really have stamina,<br /> but there's something bothering me, what do you all have against profile pictures?<br /> this conversation is too grey, could use some color, just saying :/<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T15:27:02-07:00","id":1418607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1418606#post1418606\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">you guys really have stamina,<br /> but there's something bothering me, what do you all have against profile pictures?<br /> this conversation is too grey, could use some color, just saying :/</div> </div> </div> </div> I am rather new to this forum, but I will work on that, I promise <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T15:28:27-07:00","id":1418608,"title":"","content":"The players do not choose for themselves those rules of morality: they are the product of haggling and compromise between each player and the Storyteller. A player who chose his path has chosen his morality. A player who haggle for Tenets compromised the morality of his character with that of antoher player.<br /> In one case (old rules), the player gives me a hierarchy of sin, which he choosed freely without input from others, and I as a storyteller just have to check it. In the other case we have several contractual parties (me, and each player) and we must compromise and search for common tenets, and then agree on the meaning of those tenets.<br /> So in my case, the tenets would not be chose by players, but by the compromise of each player with the other (so six people that must agree with each other) plus me.<br /> With the old rules...I just ask which path the player has chosen and we start the campaign.<br /> <br /> So in one case, the player is judged by a choice made by HIM and SIX other people, basically a multilateral contract.<br /> On the other hand, we have a player who is judged by the choice that HE made, an unilateral contract.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 10-16-2020, 06:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T19:20:25-07:00","id":1418624,"title":"","content":"Okay, so Harmony, Humanity, Power and Inner Voice, Metamorphosis make up the group. You need three Tenets that would work for all those moralities. How about...<br /> <br /> Do not lose yourself to the Beast<br /> Do not murder indiscriminately<br /> Be respectful<br /> <br /> I don't have easy access at moment, but don't think those three would conflict with any of the original hierarchy of sins. And I disagree that Paths were better under the old system. Just look at Feral Heart (or as I like to call it, Harmony with Conviction!). You can never become a paragon and stay with the Sabbat. The sins about politics and being around fire kinda put a damper on that. \ud83d\ude1c","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","name":"PJ123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T02:15:20-07:00","id":1419333,"title":"","content":"From a position of ignorance I'll say that I'm not thrilled about the idea, and some other clan should join the Sabbat to make it a duology in terms of power struggle within that sect. But I want to be open minded and not reject a change just because it shakes things up.<br /> <br /> So I'll give it a shot and see if this idea can fly well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-22T14:56:01-07:00","id":1419650,"title":"","content":"If I were to do a campaign based on the Lasombra joining the Camarilla I think I'd do it where its a multi arch storyline where in the end the Inner Circle pulls a <i>Godfather </i>Michael at the baptism routine. That's about how I imagine things would go.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Hecata are a sect not a clan.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24211-frontline989","name":"Frontline989","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-22T15:45:17-07:00","id":1419662,"title":"","content":"My weakness for inappropriate slapstick absurdity demands that the Inner Circle and Les Amis Noir both schedule their respective debt settling killing sprees on the same night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-22T15:45:49-07:00","id":1419663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gurkhal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417630-what-do-you-think-of-the-lasombra-joining-the-camarilla-in-v5?p=1419333#post1419333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From a position of ignorance I'll say that I'm not thrilled about the idea, and some other clan should join the Sabbat to make it a duology in terms of power struggle within that sect. But I want to be open minded and not reject a change just because it shakes things up.<br /> <br /> So I'll give it a shot and see if this idea can fly well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, the Sabbat have every clan as part of their structure so no clan CAN join them really.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type"